{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tiksly-affiliate-apis-full-001",
    "name": "Tiksly Affiliate Tool APIs",
    "description": "Complete API coverage for affiliate-tool-apis.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Import this collection + `Tiksly.environment.json`.\n2. Set `baseUrl` (default `http://localhost:4000`).\n3. Run **Auth → Register** or **Login** — tokens auto-save.\n4. Platform routes need a SUPERADMIN/OPS token (seed `PLATFORM_SUPERADMIN_EMAIL`).\n5. Shop connect needs org `shopLimit` > 0 (upgrade plan / DB).\n6. Shop verify needs Redis + `npm run worker`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
